<%#
  The transient activity indicator, and the honest version of it: one signal
  while the turn runs, replaced by the answer. Naming the tools as they are
  called would need the response streamed rather than broadcast at the end.

  The subscription lives inside the bubble, so it is torn down by the same
  replacement that delivers the answer. It is a one-shot channel.
%>
<article id="<%= turn.dom_id %>" class="flex items-center gap-3">
  <%= turbo_stream_from turn.stream_name %>

  <%= render "shared/ascii_runner", classes: "text-[0.5rem]" %>

  <span class="ascii-trail font-mono text-sm text-accent" role="status">
    <span>.</span><span>.</span><span>.</span>
    <span class="sr-only">Working out the answer.</span>
  </span>
</article>
